// Cells. The cellar is a barrel maze. The still (6-8, 1) closes the north chamber (5-9, 2-3), whose only way
// in is the neck (7, 4), held by gas 06. The neck is reached only by the back aisle (7-10, 5) and (10, 6-7),
// which opens on the centre aisle only through barrel B1 (10, 8), and the centre aisle (7-9, 8), (7, 9) only
// through barrel B2 (7, 10). B2 is pushed east from (6, 10) into its niche (8, 10); then B1 is pushed east
// from (9, 8) into its niche (11, 8): the source's two barrels to push before the centre aisle opens.
// Neither barrel can be pushed any other way before that, so no push strands the player. The barrels are
// Strength boulders (objects 5 and 6) and come back on reload.
// Legend (char: metatile/collision/elevation, what):
//   q 566/1/0 wall, top-left corner
//   a 551/1/0 wall top
//   Q 567/1/0 wall, top-right corner
//   L 574/1/0 wall, left
//   b 559/1/0 wall face
//   c 565/1/0 the still (Mathias's alembic), solid
//   R 575/1/0 wall, right
//   f 610/1/0 barrel stack, solid
//   s 571/0/3 floor in the wall's shadow
//   . 568/0/3 plank floor (encounters)
//   ^ 570/0/3 sticky floor, spilt rum (decor)
//   o 609/0/3 loose staves (decor, walkable)
//   D 555/1/0 the elevator door, solid (its sign calls the hub)
